{"4568450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Torin's Greed", "steam_appid": 4568450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torin's greed</strong> is a FPS is a FPS Dungeon Mining game. Use your pickaxe to mine through the dungeon to find gold and shoot monster enemies to go further down the dungeon for gold. Uncover new areas and find upgrades along the way with this unique mining shooting exploration game<br><br><strong>$ Explore the Dungeons For Riches $</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden treasure chests, but tread lightly—one false move can spring a deadly trap. Fight off the goblin tribe and claim the ultimate prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/c1eed31fe4c26d49bc71d21585f8c04c.poster.avif?t=1783136716\" width=958 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/c1eed31fe4c26d49bc71d21585f8c04c.webm?t=1783136716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/c1eed31fe4c26d49bc71d21585f8c04c.mp4?t=1783136716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue Fellow Explorers</strong><br><strong></strong><br>You aren't the first to seek these riches. Many who came before you have been captured or consumed by their own greed. Rescue these fallen adventurers to unlock powerful upgrades and prepare yourself for the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/733937cb6f63125a279297d2b7680c47.poster.avif?t=1783136716\" width=958 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/733937cb6f63125a279297d2b7680c47.webm?t=1783136716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/733937cb6f63125a279297d2b7680c47.mp4?t=1783136716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Vanquish Legendary Foes</strong><br><strong></strong><br> The dungeon is home to more than just mindless monsters. Face formidable bosses from ancient dragons to malevolent entities who hoard the gold for themselves. Overcome these deadly guardians to claim the riches they guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/7146fba8f6db1cce29ae80c80d7f5887.poster.avif?t=1783136716\" width=958 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/7146fba8f6db1cce29ae80c80d7f5887.webm?t=1783136716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568450/extras/7146fba8f6db1cce29ae80c80d7f5887.mp4?t=1783136716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Epic Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 2 hours of hand-crafted gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completionism's Dream:</strong> Discover and unlock rare collectibles hidden throughout the depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a charming, stylized low-poly world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Dungeon Crawling:</strong> Experience traditional exploration with a reliable save system.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=